work_units.notes:
Move the shared natural query-ID sort key to
`benchbox/core/visualization/utils.py`, for example
`natural_query_sort_key(value: str) -> tuple[float, str]`.

Preserve exact behavior:
  - IDs with digits sort by numeric value;
  - suffix/prefix text remains the tie-breaker;
  - IDs without digits sort after numeric IDs;
  - return type remains compatible with existing sort calls.

Update `ascii_runtime.py` and `result_plotter.py` to import the helper.

Tests should cover:
  - `Q1`, `Q2`, `Q10` natural ordering;
  - bare numeric IDs if currently supported by callers;
  - suffix cases such as `Q14a`;
  - nonnumeric IDs sorting after numeric IDs;
  - `ResultPlotter._sort_results_by_version()` still sorts platform
    version labels as before.

Prefer tests near existing visualization unit tests; avoid broad test
rewrites.
